      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Engineering secondary-phase topology can improve room-temperature compressive ductility while retaining high yield strength in a refractory HEA.",
